    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d204">

                <pb facs="0277" n="263" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p1/pg263"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890F.7962/12–1848: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Legation in Saudi Arabia
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-12-30T16:00:00-05:00">December 30,
                            1948—4 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>482. Depts State and Natl Defense gratified progress re renewal Dhahran Air Base
                    Agreement reported Legtels 647, 648, 649, 651 Dec 18 and 655 Dec 20,
                    particularly willingness SAG consider problem
                    renewal separately larger defense needs.</p>
                <p>Re Legtel 666, Dec 29,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d204-f1"/> discussions here center on
                    question whether adequate funds will be granted by Congress if Dhahran Air Base
                    Agreement on year-by-year basis only. Dept hopes send you reply Legtel 648 Dec
                    18 in about ten days.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
